    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      605.95,
      549.72,
      631.29
    ],
    "text": "(b) direct that an outline physical plan shall be prepared for the \u201cDikwella Deegawalukarama Rajamaha Viharaya\u201d, which is declared as above to be an Urban Development area.",
